<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">Next layout</view><view class="title">新建 Layout</view><view class="intro">新的 Layout 不会修改已发布线路。上传墙图后即可开始标注。</view><input class="field" placeholder="Layout 名称，例如 2026-09 调整版" bindinput="setLayoutName"/><button class="button upload" bindtap="chooseImage">{{imageFileId?'重新上传墙图':'选择墙图'}}</button><image wx:if="{{imagePath}}" class="preview" src="{{imagePath}}" mode="aspectFill"/><button class="button primary" loading="{{saving}}" bindtap="create">创建并开始标注</button></view>
